WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.647
Claude Code is building in Gem Island.

00:00:05.652 --> 00:00:07.916
Before a big change like this ring of gems,

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:09.251
it saves a checkpoint:

00:00:09.251 --> 00:00:11.452
a copy of the scene to go back to.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:13.426
Say you don't like the ring.

00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:15.348
Click Claude in the top bar.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.950
Its recent actions are listed here.

00:00:18.036 --> 00:00:19.958
Click the one that made the gems.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:21.752
Blender selects them.

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:23.244
Click Undo to Here.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:25.426
It also undoes everything after

00:00:25.426 --> 00:00:27.360
that action, so it asks first.

00:00:27.365 --> 00:00:28.695
Click Undo.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:30.527
The ring is gone.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:32.536
Press Escape to close the panel.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.445
Now say this gem is exactly where you want it.

00:00:35.445 --> 00:00:36.415
Click it,

00:00:36.967 --> 00:00:38.842
open the Claude panel again,

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:41.298
and click Protect:

00:00:41.338 --> 00:00:43.248
Claude may not change it now.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.553
Ask Claude to move the gems closer,

00:00:45.553 --> 00:00:47.057
and the call is refused:

00:00:47.144 --> 00:00:48.624
one of them is protected.

00:00:48.711 --> 00:00:51.295
To stop every change, click Pause.

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.867
Now even the other gems are refused,

00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:55.609
and Claude is told you paused it.

00:00:55.609 --> 00:00:57.113
Click Resume.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.351
Tell it to go on, and it moves the

00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:01.383
two gems it may change, and saves.

00:01:01.383 --> 00:01:02.701
Press Escape.

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.159
Last, a project someone sent you,

00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:06.478
saved in Downloads.

00:01:06.564 --> 00:01:08.533
Open the GameStudio menu,

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.836
choose Open Project,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.365
go to Downloads,

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.616
select the project's folder,

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.116
press Enter to open it,

00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:21.848
and click Open Game Project.

00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:25.018
The level opens, but GameStudio asks

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:27.467
before it runs any of the project's code:

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:29.116
its scripts, its packages

00:01:29.116 --> 00:01:30.805
and the game's dev server.

00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:33.731
Trust only projects from people you trust.

00:01:33.771 --> 00:01:34.950
Click Trust.

00:01:35.533 --> 00:01:36.833
GameStudio remembers your

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:38.860
answer and sets the project up.

00:01:38.946 --> 00:01:40.769
Protect, Pause, checkpoints,

00:01:40.769 --> 00:01:43.724
Undo to Here and Trust keep you in control.
